# Story page: nm-labyrinth
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: Sticky Maze
---
The maze again, but slow and syrupy and full of doors that led anywhere except where one meant to go, which is also a fair description of my twenties.

{name} crawled through molasses and memory, one sticky inch at a time.

At its heart the great coil opened one ancient eye, and the eye was {name}'s. I screamed, for the record. Quietly. In italics.
